# No Code Comments in Kotlin

Never add comments to Kotlin code. This includes:

- KDoc (`/** */`)
- Block comments (`/* */`)
- Inline comments (`//`)

Write self-documenting code using clear names instead.

## Examples

```kotlin
// ❌ BAD
// Fetch the list of direct messages
suspend fun fetch(): Result<List<DirectMessage>> { ... }

// ✅ GOOD
suspend fun fetchDirectMessages(): Result<List<DirectMessage>> { ... }
```

```kotlin
// ❌ BAD
_directs.update { current ->
    // Find the channel and update unread count
    current.map { dm ->
        if (dm.channelId == id) dm.copy(unreadCount = 0) else dm
    }
}

// ✅ GOOD
_directs.update { current ->
    current.map { dm ->
        if (dm.channelId == id) dm.copy(unreadCount = 0) else dm
    }
}
```
